# Node: atomic.ByDefinition.BuiltinProp.Surjective
# Run: litex -f examples/new_pipeline/proof_nodes/atomic/by_definition/builtin_surjective.lit
#
# Obligation: forall y {1}: exist x {1} st {y = id1(x)}
# The finite membership exist `exist x {1} st {x = 1}` seeds ambient
# witness search inside that forall (no trust).

have fn id1(x {1}) {1} = x
exist x {1} st {x = 1}
by def $surjective({1}, {1}, id1)
